/* =====================================================
   📚 DOKUMENTASI API (Untuk Referensi Developer)
===================================================== */

/**
 * ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 * 📡 API ENDPOINTS
 * ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 * 
 * 🔗 Base URL: https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXX/exec
 * 
 * ─── GET REQUESTS (Fetch Data) ─────────────────────────
 * GET /exec
 *   → Return semua data Vault (default)
 * 
 * GET /exec?type=notes
 *   → Return semua data Notes
 * 
 * Response format:
 * {
 *   "success": true,
 *   "data": [ {id, kategori, ...}, ... ]
 * }
 * 
 * ─── POST REQUESTS (Mutations) ─────────────────────────
 * Semua POST pakai Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
 * 
 * ➕ CREATE:
 * action=create&data_type=vault&nama_aplikasi=...&username=...&...
 * 
 * ✏️ UPDATE:
 * action=update&data_type=vault&id=VAULT-xxx&nama_aplikasi=...&...
 * 
 * 🗑️ DELETE:
 * action=delete&data_type=vault&id=VAULT-xxx
 * 
 * ⭐ TOGGLE FAVORITE:
 * action=toggle_favorite&data_type=vault&id=VAULT-xxx
 * → Return plain text: "true" atau "false"
 * 
 * 📁 UPDATE CATEGORY (Drag-drop folder):
 * action=update_category&data_type=vault&id=VAULT-xxx&new_kategori=Baru
 * 
 * 🔄 SYNC QUEUE (Offline data):
 * action=sync_queue&queue_items=[{action:"create",data_type:"vault",...},...]
 * 
 * 📊 REORDER FOLDERS:
 * action=reorder_folders&data_type=vault&folder_order=["A","B","C"]
 * 
 * ─── RESPONSE FORMAT ───────────────────────────────────
 * Success:
 * { "success": true, "message": "...", "data": {...}, "id": "..." }
 * 
 * Error:
 * { "success": false, "error": "Pesan error", "message": "..." }
 * 
 * ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 */
